   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our investment in SunCulture is the first transaction under our Memorandum of Understanding with the Shell Foundation and our first direct investment in the carbon credits market. The facility will allow SunCulture to test how carbon credit revenue can be used to lower the upfront cost of solar water pumps, improving the affordability of solar irrigation systems, mitigating greenhouse gas emissions, and improving the adaptation and resilience of smallholder farmers.</narrative>
